allah o akbar haye mera sona akbar<br>
aaj aakhri dede aza , aaj aakhri dede aza<br>
tujh pe yeh pidar qurbaan<br>
<br>
1. aaj aye hum shakl-e-rasool allah<br>
jaag utthe dasht-e-karbobala<br>
islam na bhoolega<br>
ta hashr yeh teri aza<br>
<br>
2. haiya ala qairil amal ki sada<br>
aye akbar hoor jab sunlega<br>
jal uthegi shamm-e-yaqee<br>
chatt jayega wahmo guma<br>
<br>
3. har waqt machalta rahta hai<br>
abbas ki aankhon mein dariya<br>
agaaz-e-moharram se<br>
be chain hain ammu jaan<br>
<br>
4. hum log bacha kar laaye hai<br>
maqtal se nova-e-ill allah<br>
hulkhoom mein burida se<br>
karna hain yahi elaan<br>
<br>
5. zakhmo ka sehra bandhwa kar<br>
ab maut se rishta karlea<br>
beta teri maa ko hai<br>
teri shadi ka armaan<br>
<br>
6. ab haq ke qabiley walon<br>
ko milan hai gale talwaron se<br>
aaj aal-e-mohammed mein<br>
hogi eid-e-qurban<br>
<br>
7. duniya mein musalma naam ke hain<br>
zehnon ke andhere shaam ke hain<br>
teri roop ke kirno se<br>
roshan hain yeh sara jahan<br>
<br>
8. kya dekh sakenge qalil-ullah<br>
ghash khajayenge zabi-ullah<br>
tere sinaye zaqmi se<br>
jab khenchona nok-e-sina
